{"path":"utility/bitset/operator_cmp","title":"std::bitset<N>::operator==, std::bitset<N>::operator!=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::bitset&lt;N&gt;::</span>operator==, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::bitset&lt;N&gt;::</span>operator!=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_cmp","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_1\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx20\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns true if all of the bits in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns true if any of the bits in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are not equal.</div>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> bitset to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the value of each bit in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> equals the value of the corresponding bit in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Compare given bitsets to determine if they are identical:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu6\">0b0011</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b2<span class=\"br0\">(</span>b1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b3<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu6\">0b0100</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"b1 == b2: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>b1 <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> b2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"b1 == b3: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>b1 <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> b3<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"b1&nbsp;!= b3: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>b1 <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> b3<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">//  b1 == std::bitset&lt;3&gt;{}; // compile-time error: incompatible types</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>b1 == b2: true\nb1 == b3: false\nb1&nbsp;!= b3: true</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/bitset","title":"std::bitset"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::bitset<N>::operator==, std::bitset<N>::operator!=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++20. Returns true if all of the bits in *this and rhs are equal."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the value of each bit in *this equals the value of the corresponding bit in rhs, otherwise false."},{"label":"Example","note":"Compare given bitsets to determine if they are identical:"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20","C++23"],"wordCount":187,"codeBlockCount":2}
